## Completion gate

- [ ] Every acceptance criterion is passed with evidence.
- [ ] Every implementation and required fix node is passed or superseded with rationale.
- [ ] Every finding has a final disposition.
- [ ] No finding remains `investigate` or `open`.
- [ ] Under `none`, no accepted finding remains `deferred`; with an explicit threshold, none at or above it remains unresolved or deferred.
- [ ] Every repaired root-cause cluster has targeted validation; `P0`, `P1`, and otherwise high-risk clusters have independent closure evidence.
- [ ] Every feasible regression check was attempted; no introduced failure remains; pre-existing or environmental failures are evidenced.
- [ ] Fresh final review found no unresolved defect required by the active completion policy.
- [ ] Residual risks and unavailable validation are documented.

